bowman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Light Rapid Crossbowman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A light crossbowman who can fire three bolts at once. The price of such on-demand firepower is their weakness in long-time battles.","abilities":["Launches a Straight Shot when positioned in a straight line with an allied unit: fires 3 bolts in the target's direction"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":4500,"atk":350,"def":180,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"coalition_army_hound":{"slug":"coalition_army_hound","name":"Coalition Army Hound","icon":"/enemies-icons/Coalition Army Hound.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Infected Creature","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A hound trained by the Bolívar Coalition Army. Perro officers were not too enthused about this being introduced into their tactical considerations.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.9,"stats":{"hp":2500,"atk":320,"def":100,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.4}},"heavy_crossbowman_ambusher":{"slug":"heavy_crossbowman_ambusher","name":"Heavy Crossbowman Ambusher","icon":"/enemies-icons/Heavy Crossbowman Ambusher.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A sniper issued with a mass-produced kinetically-boosted crossbow. Though expensive, they are well worth the price tag, capable of stunning targets for long durations after being charged up.","abilities":["Invisible","Launches a Straight Shot when positioned in a straight line with an allied unit: fires 1 bolt in the target's direction that deals Arts damage and inflicts Stun"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"mo